<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Through suff’ring Thou, O Christ, didst go</l><l>Unto Thy throne above,</l><l>And leadest now the selfsame way</l><l>Those true in faith and love;</l><l>So lead us, then, though suff’rings wait,</l><l>To share Thy kingdom’s heav’nly state;</l><l>Thy death has broken Satan’s might,</l><l>And leads the faithful to the light;</l><l>Eternal light, from darkness into light.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Thou hast, O Savior, led the way</l><l>Through agony and death;</l><l>O give, we pray, yet more and more</l><l>Thy Spirit’s living breath!</l><l>Send messengers o’er land and sea</l><l>To bring Thy children all to Thee;</l><l>Thy name can save, Thy name makes free;</l><l>We consecrate ourselves to Thee</l><l>As servants true, as warriors brave and true.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
